        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-connectors-p15-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "established factor + 加上 + additional factor",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "加上 adds a contributing factor to one already established. The combined factors support the following outcome.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "天冷，加上下雨，我不想出去。",
                "pinyin": "tiān lěng ， jiāshàng xiàyǔ ， wǒ bù xiǎng chūqù 。",
                "meaning": "It is cold, and with the rain as well, I do not want to go out.",
                "audio": "0af5ca02112b84e873295de63862c092befabb3aadb74df8760174925bd8e8b5"
              },
              {
                "text": "工作多，加上没睡好，他很累。",
                "pinyin": "gōngzuò duō ， jiāshàng méi shuì hǎo ， tā hěn lèi 。",
                "meaning": "He has a lot of work, and on top of that he slept poorly, so he is tired.",
                "audio": "0706103a3c6c26bceec632354cf5fdef75ba3fc7761f3eae6dd1469759b1b81a"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
